    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79885" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρωνύ̆μ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deviating from the sense,
				slightly altered in sense</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				757d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρωνύμιον, τό</span>, <i>name formed from another by a slight
				change, derivative</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				268c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.198
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				160.3
			</span></i>; in full, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Conj.</u>
				253.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>surname,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sammelb.
				3787.4
			</span></i>; = Lat. <i>cognomen</i> or <i>agnomen</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fab.</u>
				1
			</span></i>.</div>
